1
00:00:06,020 --> 00:00:10,670
Strategies you bought or are trying are under Purchased. Your own, and ones you added from the Marketplace, are under My Strategies.

2
00:00:10,770 --> 00:00:15,340
Type in the search box to find one.

3
00:00:15,440 --> 00:00:20,340
Click the star to mark a favourite.

4
00:00:20,440 --> 00:00:25,300
Right-click a strategy for more: run, test, edit, rename, copy, publish or delete.

5
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:31,130
Import adds a strategy file that you were sent. New starts one from scratch or from a template.

6
00:00:31,230 --> 00:00:38,000
Click Edit to open it in the Editor.

7
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:49,000
Click Compile to check it. No errors means it is ready.

8
00:00:49,100 --> 00:00:56,320
A mistake is listed with its line. Click it to jump there and fix it.

9
00:00:56,420 --> 00:01:04,650
Fixed. Save keeps your changes, and they are saved to your account too.

